==Behind the scenes==
GS-C1B first appeared in "[[Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land]]," the first episode of the live-action television series ''[[Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett]]'', which was directed by [[Robert Rodriguez]]<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" /> and released on [[December 29]], [[2021]].<ref name="Disney+">{{DisneyPlusYouTube|t9Ca4ARSfqA|Next On Disney+ &#124; December 2021}}</ref> In the episode the droid was physically portrayed by [[Leeanna Vamp]] and simply credited as "Droid Server Performance Artist".<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" /> The droid was first identified by a four-figure [[2025]] [[Star Wars: Droid Factory (toy line)|''Star Wars: Droid Factory'' toy line]] set centered around ''The Book of Boba Fett'', with one figure being GS-C1B.<ref name="Toy" />

